# A re-check for a waiting patient, ended early from the sitting screen.
# The app is started again first: in the simulator the sitting screen does not open a second
# time in one run of the app (see "Open bugs" in docs/OVERNIGHT_BACKLOG.md).
run open-app.flow
wait "Re-check" 120
tap "~Maya Chen"
wait "Start sitting" 60
tap "Start sitting"
wait "End sitting now"
sleep 12
shot recheck-running
tap "End sitting now"
wait "End the sitting now?"
shot recheck-end-early
tap "End sitting"
wait "Sitting summary" 60
wait "Re-check saved" 60
shot recheck-summary
tap "Next patient"
wait "Re-check"
